 • Text: “Monitor battery levels during parallel collection and trigger recharging if needed.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Storage  
 • Number of Robots: [1] (per storage)  
 • Justification: Ensures that each robot in the parallel mode can safely continue or reassign.

9. AT9: Return to Recharge and Reassign Mission (Parallel)  
 • Text: “Return to the recharging station and reassign the mission to another robot in parallel mode.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Recharging Station  
 • Number of Robots: [1] (per storage)  
