 • Text: “Deliver the collected resource to the destination.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Destination  
 • Number of Robots: [1]  
 • Justification: The actual delivery action is performed by a single robot.

12. AT12: Repeat Delivery if Necessary  
 • Text: “Perform additional delivery runs until all resources are delivered.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Destination  
 • Number of Robots: [1]  
 • Justification: Multiple runs may be required to complete the delivery.

13. AT13: Monitor Battery in Delivery  
 • Text: “Monitor the battery level during the delivery phase.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Delivery Route  
 • Number of Robots: [1]  
