15. AT15: Trigger Alert to Sector Manager  
 • Text: “If returning to the checkpoint fails, trigger an alert and send a report to the sector manager.”  
 • Relation: AND  
 • Location: Checkpoint  
 • Number of Robots: [1]  
 • Justification: Ensures that a failure in the fallback mechanism is reported for further action.

