This goal model captures the hierarchical decomposition of the mission into high‐level phases (collection and delivery), includes runtime annotations (sequential “;”, parallel “#”, and fallback “FALLBACK(…)”) as required, and provides clear task assignments with location and robot count details. The relationships (AND/OR) are justified based on the mission’s requirements such as sequential dependency between navigation and resource retrieval, parallelism when multiple storages are involved, and fallback mechanisms for battery management.

